  "_twist": {
    "sourceSystem": "hydra",
    "type": "press-displacement-bauhaus",
    "intensity": 4,
    "description": "Press Displacement (Bauhaus mechanical): Active state shifts element translate(2px, 2px) — simulating a physical button pressed into a surface. No shadow, no decoration — displacement IS the signal. Instant 0s transition on active press. Return in 0.15s linear. Focus ring: 2px solid, zero offset — hard-edged mechanical indicator, no easing. Linear timing throughout. Rejects organic curves — functional mechanics only."
